--- !u!1001 &7182869
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: continueInput
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 294107746}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 55
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[10].text
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[11].text
      value: So...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[12].text
      value: How come you called me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[13].text
      value: What?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[14].text
      value: I don't know. We just haven't spoken in so long...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[15].text
      value: It was my birthday a few weeks ago...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[16].text
      value: Oh, happy late birthday! Did you do anything?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[17].text
      value: Yeah. I...threw a party.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[18].text
      value: How was that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[19].text
      value: Nobody came.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[20].text
      value: Oh, God. I'm sorry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[21].text
      value: Yeah, I was...really upset.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[22].text
      value: Just...made me realize how alone I really am.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[23].text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[24].text
      value: I think I know how you feel.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[25].text
      value: You spent your birthday alone too?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[26].text
      value: I'm always alone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[27].text
      value: I don't have any real reason to leave my apartment.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[28].text
      value: What's going on in the news has only made me stay in more too.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[29].text
      value: So I just...am always by myself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[30].text
      value: Would you ever live with someone?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[31].text
      value: I've tried.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[32].text
      value: But every time I talk to anyone, I just can't...connect.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[33].text
      value: Like there's this blur that comes over me. And the one person I'm talking
        to just kinda smiles and nods.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[34].text
      value: And then they leave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[35].text
      value: They always leave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[36].text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[37].text
      value: I should've called earlier.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[38].text
      value: You didn't know. I didn't know about you either.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[40].text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[41].text
      value: You still didn't answer my question though.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[42].text
      value: Why did you call me? Not anyone else?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[43].text
      value: I think you're the only person in this city who understands.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[44].text
      value: I think every person in this city would understand.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[45].text
      value: We just don't talk about it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[47].text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[48].text
      value: We should do something for your birthday, though! It was only a few
        weeks ago, right?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[49].text
      value: Yeah! What were you thinking?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[50].text
      value: (a bunch of options pop up. all are correct)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[51].text
      value: That sounds great! Thanks!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[52].text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[53].text
      value: I'm really glad we did this.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[54].text
      value: I'm glad we did this too.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3462590240804146244, guid: 627028f9c9a2e284ca1d7096c851ba1a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[10].speakerID
      value: title drop
